dent microbial oxidation of ferrous iron. Applied and Environmental Microbiology, 62, 1458&#x2013;1460.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC1388836</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">16535298</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>

